<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T U.S. soy, corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T U.S. soy, corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Tuesday for a combined shipment of 20,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 10,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans, local traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Shipment would be slated for November 15-30 delivery from the U.S. Gulf or December 1-15 from the Pacific Northwest, or November 20 to December 5 from the U.S. Gulf or December 5-20 from the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
